(1. About the Hotel) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
() Tj T*
(The Grand Azure Bay Hotel is a five-star seaside resort with 120 rooms and suites overlooking) Tj T*
(Azure Bay. The hotel opened in 2012 and was fully renovated in 2023. Facilities include an) Tj T*
(infinity pool, a spa and wellness centre, a fitness studio open 24 hours, two restaurants, a) Tj T*
(rooftop bar, and 600 square metres of meeting and event space. Complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi) Tj T*
(is available throughout the property.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
/F2 12 Tf
(2. Location and Getting There) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
() Tj T*
(The hotel is located at 18 Marina Promenade, Azure Bay, directly on the waterfront and a) Tj T*
(five-minute walk from the Old Town. Azure Bay International Airport is 22 kilometres away,) Tj T*
(roughly 30 minutes by car. The hotel offers a private airport transfer for 45 dollars each way;) Tj T*
(bookings should be made at least 24 hours in advance through the concierge. Azure Bay Central) Tj T*
(railway station is 3 kilometres from the hotel, and the number 12 bus stops directly outside) Tj T*
(the main entrance. On-site underground parking is available for 20 dollars per night, and) Tj T*
(electric vehicle charging points are provided free of charge.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
/F2 12 Tf
(3. Rooms and Rates) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
() Tj T*
(The hotel offers three room categories. Standard Rooms are 28 square metres with a queen bed) Tj T*
(and a garden or city view, from 120 dollars per night. Deluxe Rooms are 38 square metres with a) Tj T*
(king bed, a private balcony and a sea view, from 190 dollars per night. Suites are 65 square) Tj T*
(metres with a separate living room, a marble bathroom with a bathtub, and a panoramic bay view,) Tj T*
(from 320 dollars per night. All rooms include air conditioning, a minibar, a safe, a Nespresso) Tj T*
(machine and blackout curtains. Interconnecting rooms and accessible rooms are available on) Tj T*
(request.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
/F2 12 Tf
(4. Hygiene and Safety) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
() Tj T*
(The Grand Azure Bay Hotel follows an enhanced cleaning protocol. All guest rooms are cleaned) Tj T*
(daily with hospital-grade disinfectants, and high-touch surfaces such as door handles, remote) Tj T*
(controls, light switches and lift buttons are sanitised every two hours in public areas. Rooms) Tj T*
(are left vacant for a minimum of four hours between guests and are treated with electrostatic) Tj T*
(sprayers before a new check-in. Bed linen and towels are laundered at 70 degrees Celsius.) Tj T*
(Hand-sanitiser stations are placed at every entrance, at the reception desk, in the lifts and) Tj T*
(in all restaurants. Kitchen staff hold current food-safety certifications and the kitchens are) Tj T*
(independently audited every quarter. The hotel is fully non-smoking, is equipped with smoke) Tj T*
(detectors and sprinklers in every room, and has a first-aid trained staff member on duty 24) Tj T*
(hours a day. A doctor can be called to the hotel at any time. The pool water is tested three) Tj T*
(times a day and a lifeguard is on duty from 8:00 to 20:00.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
