(signature dish of the Grand Azure Bay Hotel is the Azure Bay Grilled Sea Bass, a locally caught) Tj T*
(sea bass served with saffron risotto, charred lemon and a herb butter sauce, prepared by) Tj T*
(executive chef Marco Bellini. The restaurant offers a dedicated vegetarian menu with at least) Tj T*
