(6. Reservation Policies) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf
() Tj T*
(Check-in is from 15:00 and check-out is by 11:00. Early check-in and late check-out are subject) Tj T*
(to availability and may incur a fee of 40 dollars. A valid photo ID and a credit card are) Tj T*
(required at check-in. Reservations can be cancelled free of charge up to 48 hours before the) Tj T*
(check-in date. Cancellations made less than 48 hours before check-in are charged one night's) Tj T*
(stay, and no-shows are charged the full amount of the reservation. Non-refundable promotional) Tj T*
(rates cannot be cancelled or modified. Modifications to the dates of a booking are free of) Tj T*
(charge when made more than 48 hours before arrival and are subject to availability. The maximum) Tj T*
(length of stay for a single booking is 30 nights. Children under 12 stay free when sharing a) Tj T*
(room with their parents. Pets are not permitted, with the exception of certified assistance) Tj T*
(animals.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
